## 二叉树的查找

```c
struct Binode *Find_x(struct Binode *root, char x)
{
    if (root == NULL) return NULL;
    struct Binode *px = root;
    while (px)
    {
        if (px->data > x)
            px = px->lchild;
        else if (px->data < x)
            px = px->rchild;
        else
            return px;
    }
    return NULL;
}
